# Pairs with ContactOnlyWhenAdmitted. Contact is recorded for every run the
# receiver sees, so a peer grows the telemetry state with tree ids it chose.
MODULE: ReceiverContactBeforeGate
TARGET: ContactOnlyWhenAdmitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: inbound contact is recorded for a run the gate did not admit
PERTURBS: ApplyRun

--- FIND
        record == result = "applied" /\ (<<t, o>> \in contact \/ Cardinality(contact) < Cap)
--- REPLACE
        record == (<<t, o>> \in contact \/ Cardinality(contact) < Cap)
--- END